    "  - placedAt gained millisecond precision when the column type changed",
    "",
    "Not one of those is a breaking change for the dashboard. All three break",
    "the build. See docs/05-the-brittle-contract-walkthrough.md, and the diff",
    "against ../resilient/web-dashboard-orders-api.json."
